
$

PROJECT 'KARIMUN' '001'
SET 0 MAXERR 99  NAUTICAL  
&MODE NONSTationary TWODimensional
&COORDinates SPHE CCM

MODE NONSTATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
&SET DEPMIN 0.05 INRHOG 1 NAUTICAL PWTAIL 5
COORDINATES SPHERICAL


&& KEYWORD for number of nested SWAN grids.
NSGRIDS 2

&& KEYWORDS TO CREATE AND READ COMPUTATIONAL GRID &&
CGRID CURVILINEAR 97 73 EXC 9.999000e+003 9.999000e+003 CIRCLE 24 0.04 1.0 28
READGRID COORDINATES 1 '/home/tr16/COAWST_3.7/Projects/karimun/swan3km.grd' 3 0 0 FREE 

&& KEYWORDS TO CREATE AND READ BATHYMETRY GRID &&
INPGRID BOTTOM CURVILINEAR 0 0 112 106 EXC 9.999000e+003
READINP BOTTOM 1 '/home/tr16/COAWST_3.7/Projects/karimun/swan3km.bot' 3 0 FREE 

$******************** ERA5 Wind  *********************************************

&& KEYWORD TO CREATE WIND GRID &&
&INPGRID WIND REGULAR 100 -11 0 111 106 0.1 0.1 &
&NONSTATIONARY 20221229.000000 6 HR 20221230.000000
&READINP WIND 1 '/home/tr16/COAWST_3.7/Projects/karimun/swan' 3 0 FREE

$ Boundary and Initial Conditions ****************************************
& BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP PEAK DSPR DEGREES
INITIAL DEFAULT
						  
$ PHYSICS  ****************************************
&BREAKING CONSTANT 1.0 0.73
BREaking CONstant gamma .78
TRIad
FRICTION
&FRICTION MADSEN 0.05
&OFF QUAD
&GEN3 KOMEN
GEN3 JANSSEN 4.5 0.9
&WCAP KOM 2.36E-5 3.02E-3 2.0 1.0 1.0
PROP BSBT
NUM ACCUR NONSTAT MXITNS=2

$************************* Outputs ********************************
$ Output/Satellite  Altimeter Tracks 

&RESTART 'swan_ref3km_rst.dat' FREE 1 HR

$

& This command orders SWAN to start the computation(s).
COMPUTE NONSTAT 20230501.000000 540 SEC 20230501.060000

&HOTFILE 'karimun.hot'

STOP


